1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:05,870
80% of enterprise data is unstructured.

2
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:09,270
Documents, emails, scans and images:

3
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:12,380
no rows, no columns, no rules.

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,980
And with no rules,

5
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:16,160
it goes wherever people put it.

6
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:19,050
So yours is everywhere: inboxes,

7
00:00:19,090 --> 00:00:22,290
drives, old servers, someone's laptop.

8
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:25,830
Four moves change that.

9
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:28,520
Unify content: every source,

10
00:00:28,560 --> 00:00:30,810
one place, one set of rules.

11
00:00:30,850 --> 00:00:33,050
Find and collaborate: search,

12
00:00:33,090 --> 00:00:35,200
share, and sign, safely.

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:38,190
Automate and govern: work that routes itself,

14
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,290
and rules that keep themselves.

15
00:00:40,340 --> 00:00:43,100
Make content intelligent: Document AI,

16
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:45,220
and the Solix AI Assistant.

17
00:00:48,180 --> 00:00:52,320
The problem: data sprawl. One project's files,

18
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,160
in every version and format,

19
00:00:54,200 --> 00:00:57,340
scattered across multiple places and locations.

20
00:00:57,750 --> 00:01:00,030
Move one: bring it all in.

21
00:01:00,070 --> 00:01:02,360
Drop in files, and whole folders.

22
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,240
Send a link,

23
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,490
and clients upload without an account.

24
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:07,330
Capture email from Gmail,

25
00:01:07,370 --> 00:01:09,590
and unpack old PST archives.

26
00:01:09,630 --> 00:01:12,310
Move Exchange, Google Drive and SFTP in,

27
00:01:12,350 --> 00:01:14,220
mapped to their owners.

28
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:17,450
Now there's one place, and one set of rules.

29
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,050
The problem: finding the right version,

30
00:01:21,090 --> 00:01:22,810
and sharing it safely.

31
00:01:23,270 --> 00:01:26,560
Move two: find it, share it, finish it.

32
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:28,080
Search across files,

33
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,610
scans and email, in seconds.

34
00:01:30,650 --> 00:01:32,290
Preview without downloading,

35
00:01:32,330 --> 00:01:34,670
mark it up, and redact what's private.

36
00:01:34,710 --> 00:01:37,950
Share inside and out, with links that expire,

37
00:01:37,990 --> 00:01:39,870
and downloads switched off.

38
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:42,380
Comment, tag, and send for signature,

39
00:01:42,420 --> 00:01:44,060
without leaving the page.

40
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,410
No more “can you resend it?”

41
00:01:47,210 --> 00:01:48,320
The problem:

42
00:01:48,460 --> 00:01:51,430
rules that live in spreadsheets, and memory.

43
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:55,050
Move three: let it run by the rules.

44
00:01:55,090 --> 00:01:56,650
Workflows route review,

45
00:01:56,690 --> 00:01:59,410
approval and signature, on their own.

46
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:02,130
Retention keeps every record on schedule,

47
00:02:02,170 --> 00:02:04,230
and deletes only with approval.

48
00:02:04,270 --> 00:02:07,020
Legal hold freezes what a case needs.

49
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:10,860
Labels, roles and single sign-on decide who can see,

50
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:12,480
share, or delete.

51
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:14,920
And every action is on the record,

52
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:16,330
ready to export.

53
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:20,660
The problem: content that just sits there.

54
00:02:20,950 --> 00:02:23,130
Move four: put it to work.

55
00:02:23,170 --> 00:02:26,410
Document AI reads scans and fills in the fields,

56
00:02:26,450 --> 00:02:27,640
tables included.

57
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,490
Search by what's inside.

58
00:02:29,730 --> 00:02:31,610
Then ask the Solix AI Assistant.

59
00:02:31,650 --> 00:02:35,620
Summarize a file, ask about a whole folder,

60
00:02:35,660 --> 00:02:38,350
and every answer comes with its sources.

61
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:41,180
Bring it in.

62
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:42,370
Find it.

63
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:43,490
Govern it.

64
00:02:43,550 --> 00:02:44,810
Put it to work.

65
00:02:45,360 --> 00:02:47,170
Solix ECS.

66
00:02:47,210 --> 00:02:51,000
Keep the proof.
